  "details": "Before the UI toggles, I would like it so that pressing ESC brings up a small box with a compact grid of 16 menu options. The current UI/UX is too large, making it unsuitable for quickly checking other players' statuses, and the process of seeing who is in the current instance takes too long. Additionally, I’d like an option to disable the \"send to invite?\" prompt, so invites are sent immediately upon clicking, as before. It would also be helpful to have the option to select multiple friends at once and send invites to them all simultaneously.",
